  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f988bc0d55107749a911c0375bba164, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_ProfessorDispatchReynard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: That partner of yours is logged. Good. Now I need you to keep the lab from
      seizing up
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Hustle over to Reynard. Fox. Coffee cart on the docks. His bean shipment's
      stalling, and that's my fuel line
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Tell him Toby wants two black coffees and one cold beer. Don't look at
      me like that. Research is thirsty work
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Check in with him, then get back here before the engines overheat. Go.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 2
  allowSkip: 1
  skipToEndOfLine: 1
